message: "If you use this research compendium, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Category-Specific Sentinel-2 NDVI Differences among Level-1C, Sen2Cor, and LaSRC in a Tropical Silvopastoral Landscape: Open Science Reproducibility Compendium"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility compendium for a Sentinel-2 NDVI method-comparison study across
  Level-1C/TOA, Sen2Cor L2A/SR, and LaSRC L2A/SR observations in a tropical
  silvopastoral landscape of the Colombian Orinoco Piedmont (2019-2020; 1,797 common
  polygon-by-date observations from 106 management polygons on 22 farms). The public
  package includes the manuscript source, analysis and figure code, final figures,
  derived summary tables, input-scene and auxiliary-data manifests, provenance records,
  and computational-environment records. Farm-boundary and management-polygon
  geometries are governed by the Sustainable Cattle Ranching project and are not
  publicly distributed.
